## 4. Instruction body behavior

| Situation | Body handling |
|-----------|----------------|
| No actions | Body appended to each `prompts[]` link, or creates one prompt if empty |
| Actions start with `$` that consumes prompts | Body prepended into `prompts[]` before first `$` |
| Other actions | Body merged with prompts after pipeline (compose / append per link) |
| Body-only `@ref` (no actions on target) | Body text appended to **each** input prompt link separately |

---

## 5. Changes array

Tuples: `(content_type, operation, data)`

| Field           | Values |
|----------------|--------|
| `content_type` | `prompt`, `text`, `image`, `sound`, `video`, `file`, … |
| `operation`    | `add`, `del`, `join` |
| `data`         | For `del`: link id to remove. For `add`: path or content. For `join`: `{sources, text}` |

After each step, the runtime applies pending `changes[]` and clears the array.

