## 6. Externals (`$`)

Registered handlers (see `externals/__init__.py`). Per-external detail: `externals/<name>/_description`. Subprocess and GPU lifecycle: `externals/SUBPROCESS.md`.

| External | Role |
|----------|------|
| `$file`, `$folder` | Load file(s) from disk into arrays by extension |
| `$save` | Write array data to a path by extension |
| `$output` | Session output helper |
| `$image` | FLUX / LoRA text-to-image (diffusers) |
| `$image2image` | Qwen-Rapid-AIO prompt-guided edit (`comfy_lib` in-process; warm GPU worker) |
| `$image2video` | Wan MEGA image→video (`comfy_lib` in-process by default; warm GPU worker) |
| `$image2text` | Qwen2-VL vision-language |
| `$comfy` | ComfyUI **server** HTTP API (workflow JSON on a running Comfy instance) |
| `$llm` | LLM text generation |
| `$code` | Local coding LLM (generates text, often .ah scripts) |
| `$ah` | Execute .ah source from texts[] (nested run; same session + callback) |
| `$texts_to_prompts`, `$prompts_to_texts` | Convert between texts and prompts |
| `$music`, `$music_separation`, `$change_voice`, `$join_stems`, `$text2speech`, `$voice_enhance` | Music / stems / RVC / mix / TTS / Resemble Enhance |
| `$image_clip`, `$video_clip`, `$clip` | Video from images/sounds or joined videos + sound |
| `$sound2text` | Speech-to-text (optional JSON word timestamps) |
| `$draw_text` | Overlay multiline text on `images[]` (Pillow) |
| `$only` | Keep only listed arrays, e.g. `$only(images, prompts)` |
| `$select` | Pick elements by index, e.g. `$select(sounds=[1], texts=[0])` |
| `$check_image` | Image validation (may emit `del` changes) |
| `$clear` | Clear arrays |
| `$list`, `$first_image`, `$input_json` | Utilities |

**Prompt-consuming externals** (`$image`, `$image2image`, `$image2video`, `$llm`, `$music`, …) clear `prompts[]` on output after the call.

Each `$` call gets an op folder with `input.json`, `invoke.json`, and `output.json`.

### 6.1 GPU-heavy comfy in-process externals

`$image2image` and `$image2video` share `externals/comfy_inprocess/`:

- Run Comfy **workflow JSON** from `comfy_workflows/` via embedded `comfy_lib` (no Comfy server).
- Use **ComfyUI-compatible Python** with `comfy_aimdo` when available (`AH_COMFY_PYTHON`, default tries `G:\ComfyUI_V\.venv\Scripts\python.exe`).
- **Warm worker** (default): one long-lived subprocess keeps the model on GPU between jobs in the same run (`AH_*_WORKER=1`). Avoids reloading ~20–28 GB per op.
- At run end, `release_gpu_resources()` stops warm workers and empties CUDA cache (`AH_RELEASE_GPU_ON_RUN_END=1`, default).

| External | Workflow | Default checkpoint |
|----------|----------|-------------------|
| `$image2image` | `Qwen-Rapid-AIO_4.json` | `models/qwen-rapid/` (e.g. `sfw-v23`) |
| `$image2video` | `Wan_i2v_rapid__start_image.json` | `models/wan/wan2.2-i2v-rapid-aio-v10.safetensors` |

**`$image2image`:** edits `images[]` with prompts; args include `use_all=`, `model=`, `width=`/`height=`, `steps=`, `seed=`, `gpu=`.

**`$image2video`:** one MP4 per input image (start frame); requires prompt. Args include `model=` (default `wan`), `width=`/`height=`, `steps=`, `frames=`, `guidance=`/`cfg=`, `seed=`, `neg=`.

**`$image2video` backends** (`backend=` or `AH_IMAGE2VIDEO_BACKEND`):

| Value | Path |
|-------|------|
| `comfy_lib` (default) | In-process Wan I2V rapid (`WanImageToVideo`, same as WanVideo_111) |
| `diffusers` | Wan diffusers pipeline (`wan_i2v.py`; needs `uv sync --extra media`) |
| `comfy` | ComfyUI HTTP API (`COMFYUI_URL`, `COMFYUI_WORKFLOW`) |

**Subprocess / emulation env (tests and overrides):**

| Variable | Effect |
|----------|--------|
| `AH_EMULATE_IMAGE2IMAGE=1`, `AH_EMULATE_IMAGE2VIDEO=1` | Placeholder outputs, no GPU |
| `AH_EXTERNAL_INPROCESS=all` or per-name list | Skip subprocess; run in orchestrator |
| `AH_EXTERNAL_SUBPROCESS=0` | Same as in-process |
| `AH_IMAGE2IMAGE_WORKER=0`, `AH_IMAGE2VIDEO_WORKER=0` | One-shot subprocess per op (no warm worker) |
| `AH_RELEASE_GPU_ON_RUN_END=0` | Keep warm workers alive after run |

Isolated venvs: `AH_EXTERNAL_VENV_<name>` (see `.env.template`, `tools/setup_external_venvs.ps1`).

Example pipelines:

```ah
@edit: @photo -> $image2image(model='sfw-v23')
fix the hands and lighting

@animate: @still -> $image2video(model='wan', width=768, height=1280)
woman running in the park
```

